 * Proof steps:
001. F,A,B are collinear [04] & DG ∥ AB [06] ⇒  FB ∥ DG [08]
002. G,C,B are collinear [07] & E,C,B are collinear [02] ⇒  E,B,G are collinear [09]
003. FB ∥ DG [08] & E,F,D are collinear [05] & E,B,G are collinear [09] ⇒  BE:BG = FE:FD [10]
004. DG ∥ AB [06] & A,D,C are collinear [01] & G,C,B are collinear [07] ⇒  AC:BC = AD:BG [11]
005. BE:BG = FE:FD [10] & AC:BC = AD:BG [11] & CA = CB [00] & EB = AD [03] ⇒  FE = FD
